{"hits":{"hits":[{"metadata":{"authors":[{"raw_affiliations":[{"value":"Instituto de Física Teórica Universidade Estadual Paulista"}],"full_name_unicode_normalized":"lize, matheus loss","full_name":"Lize, Matheus Loss","record":{"$ref":"https://inspirehep.net/api/authors/1728359"},"ids":[{"schema":"INSPIRE BAI","value":"M.Lize.1"}],"last_name":"Lize","affiliations":[{"record":{"$ref":"https://inspirehep.net/api/institutions/903185"},"value":"Sao Paulo, IFT"}],"signature_block":"LASm","first_name":"Matheus Loss","uuid":"0c81ddeb-9918-4239-8687-94bf63392305","recid":1728359},{"raw_affiliations":[{"value":"Dept. of Physics and Astronomy Stony Brook University"}],"full_name_unicode_normalized":"lyu, bochen","full_name":"Lyu, Bochen","record":{"$ref":"https://inspirehep.net/api/authors/1925654"},"ids":[{"schema":"INSPIRE BAI","value":"B.Lyu.2"}],"last_name":"Lyu","affiliations":[{"record":{"$ref":"https://inspirehep.net/api/institutions/903237"},"value":"SUNY, Stony Brook"}],"signature_block":"Lb","first_name":"Bochen","uuid":"66a5b397-93dd-4893-93e0-dcef9feaf3f9","recid":1925654},{"raw_affiliations":[{"value":"CNYITP Stony Brook University"}],"full_name_unicode_normalized":"siegel, warren","full_name":"Siegel, Warren","record":{"$ref":"https://inspirehep.net/api/authors/988755"},"ids":[{"schema":"INSPIRE BAI","value":"W.D.Siegel.1"}],"last_name":"Siegel","affiliations":[{"curated_relation":true,"record":{"$ref":"https://inspirehep.net/api/institutions/910429"},"value":"YITP, Stony Brook"}],"signature_block":"SAGALw","first_name":"Warren","uuid":"829ea8bc-9c5e-4e90-899b-9ece7633ae88","recid":988755},{"raw_affiliations":[{"value":"Dept. of Physics and Astronomy Stony Brook University"}],"full_name_unicode_normalized":"wang, yu-ping","full_name":"Wang, Yu-Ping","curated_relation":true,"record":{"$ref":"https://inspirehep.net/api/authors/1695588"},"ids":[{"schema":"INSPIRE BAI","value":"Y.P.Wang.3"}],"last_name":"Wang","affiliations":[{"record":{"$ref":"https://inspirehep.net/api/institutions/903237"},"value":"SUNY, Stony Brook"}],"signature_block":"WANGy","first_name":"Yu-Ping","uuid":"308209c6-c3e5-4d82-badc-e0bf4fa0bc85","recid":1695588}],"abstracts":[{"source":"arXiv","value":"A new set of boundary conditions for string propagators is proposed in this paper. The boundary conditions are parametrized by a complex number $\\lambda$. Under these new boundary conditions, the left-moving and right-moving modes are treated unequally. Thus, we called them chiral string theories. If $\\lambda = -1$, the spectrum of such theory truncates to a finite number, and therefore it becomes a different description of supergravity. We found the spectrum of chiral string theories by requiring that the vertex operators are conformally invariant. In addition, we also calculate the amplitudes for arbitrary $\\lambda$. The amplitudes are expressed as a product of open string amplitudes which are similar to the KLT relation. The unitarity of these theories are investigated. However, we found out that except for $\\lambda = \\pm 1$, all other theories are not unitary; i.e., only the supergravity and ordinary strings are unitary. Although most of the chiral strings are not physical, they still serve as a valuable tool in studying the relation between particle theories and string theories.","abstract_source_suggest":{"input":"arXiv"}}],"control_number":1925651,"preprint_date":"2021-09-21","titles":[{"source":"arXiv","title":"Chiral string theories as an interpolation between strings and particles"}],"arxiv_eprints":[{"categories":["hep-th"],"value":"2109.10401"}],"document_type":["article"]},"created":"2021-09-23T03:37:10.144146+00:00","id":"1925651","updated":"2023-03-06T20:17:11.181362+00:00","links":{"bibtex":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/1925651?format=bibtex","latex-eu":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/1925651?format=latex-eu","latex-us":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/1925651?format=latex-us","json":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/1925651?format=json","json-expanded":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/1925651?format=json-expanded","cv":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/1925651?format=cv","citations":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=refersto%3Arecid%3A1925651"}}],"total":1},"links":{"self":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=arxiv%3A2109.10401&size=5&page=1&fields=titles,authors,dois,publication_info,arxiv_eprints,document_type,preprint_date,imprints,abstracts,urls","bibtex":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=arxiv%3A2109.10401&size=5&page=1&format=bibtex","latex-eu":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=arxiv%3A2109.10401&size=5&page=1&format=latex-eu","latex-us":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=arxiv%3A2109.10401&size=5&page=1&format=latex-us","json":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=arxiv%3A2109.10401&size=5&page=1&fields=titles,authors,dois,publication_info,arxiv_eprints,document_type,preprint_date,imprints,abstracts,urls&format=json","json-expanded":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=arxiv%3A2109.10401&size=5&page=1&format=json-expanded","cv":"https://inspirehep.net/api/literature/?q=arxiv%3A2109.10401&size=5&page=1&format=cv"}}